{
  "Script": "Story/MC01/Day12/Novel/MC01_12_09_00",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00000_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "First off, congratulations on completing your first mission. For your first outing, your performance was truly remarkable.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00001_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Also, I overheard on comms that you were competing to defeat the most Cancers to win the \"A\" title...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00002_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "And in the end, 31-C came out on top. In sum, 31-C is the new 31-A, correct?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00003_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Dang. So that's that, huh?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00004_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Yamawaki. Do you accept these results and this victory for your squad?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00005_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "...No.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00006_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Oh? Why not?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00007_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Because no matter what happens, our duty is to protect humanity.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00008_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You're right.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00009_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "But on this mission, I lost sight of that vital goal.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00010_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I wanted to win... I put that above all else today.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00011_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "And by doing so, I failed to protect what matters most.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00012_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "To most, protecting themselves and those closest to them is all they can manage.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00013_STezuka",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "However, the Seraph Squadron expects more of its members. Protecting oneself, one's comrades, and the world—<i>That</i> is our mission.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00014_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'm still too immature... So, this victory...belongs to them.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00015_MSatsuki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Congratulations! 31-A, you truly earned it. ♪",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00016_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Alright!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00017_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Well aren't you happy? You must've really wanted that \"A.\"",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_09_00_Novel_00018_MSatsuki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "So we still ended up losing. ♪",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}